Scope of this license

The MIT grant above applies to llang's original source in `src/llang/`, `lib/`,
`tests/`, `examples/`, `tools/` (except vendored and embedded third-party
material described below), and the documentation authored for this project.

Third-party material

This repository grounds its semantics in open-source projects and, for
verification purposes, vendors or embeds some third-party source. That material
is NOT covered by the MIT grant above; it remains under its own license, held by
its respective authors. See `NOTICE` for the complete inventory, licenses,
copyright holders, and source references. In particular:

- `tools/rewrites/pypybox2d/source/` — pypybox2d, zlib license, pinned commit
- `tools/pilots/` — CPython stdlib and humanize sources used as conversion inputs
- embedded verbatim oracle sources in `tools/compare_humanize.py` and
  `tests/test_pylev.py` — humanize (MIT) and pylev (BSD-3-Clause) respectively
